<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Token Radar — pre-token protocols ranked by implied value</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#board">Skip to the board</a>
<header class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Token launch radar &middot; DefiLlama snapshot <span id="as-of">—</span></p>
  <h1>Which pre-token protocol is worth farming next?</h1>
  <p class="lede">Every protocol DefiLlama tracks that <strong>records no token</strong>, ranked by what
  its launch would be worth if its record stayed as it is. The implied value is this
  board&rsquo;s own claim, never a promise that a token comes, or when.</p>
  <dl class="stats" id="stats"></dl>
</header>

<main id="board" tabindex="-1">
  <section class="controls" aria-label="Board controls">
    <label>Search <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Name or slug&hellip;" autocomplete="off"></label>
    <label>Category <select id="cat"><option value="">All categories</option></select></label>
    <label>Chain <select id="chain"><option value="">All chains</option></select></label>
    <label>Sort <select id="sort">
      <option value="implied">Implied value</option>
      <option value="tvl">TVL</option>
      <option value="growth">7-day change</option>
      <option value="age">Age (listed longest)</option>
    </select></label>
    <label class="check"><input id="watch" type="checkbox"> Watchlist only</label>
    <p class="count" id="count"></p>
  </section>

  <section class="table-wrap">
    <table id="board-table">
      <thead><tr>
        <th class="num">#</th><th>Protocol</th><th>Category</th><th>Chains</th>
        <th class="num">TVL</th><th class="num">7d</th><th class="num">Age</th><th class="num">Implied value</th>
      </tr></thead>
      <tbody id="rows"></tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="hint">Click any row for its detail view and farm plan.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="detail" id="detail" hidden aria-label="Protocol detail"></section>

  <section class="live" aria-label="Live token protocols">
    <h2>Already trading — the market&rsquo;s own values</h2>
    <p>Protocols that already have a token are not ranked here. Their market caps are
    shown for comparison — and they are the peers the model&rsquo;s multiples come from.</p>
    <table id="live-table">
      <thead><tr>
        <th>Protocol</th><th>Category</th><th class="num">TVL</th><th class="num">Market cap</th><th class="num">MCap / TVL</th>
      </tr></thead>
      <tbody id="live-rows"></tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section class="method" aria-label="How the board is scored">
    <h2>How the board is scored</h2>
    <div id="method-body"></div>
    <h3>What this board does not say</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>A protocol on this board <strong>records no token</strong> in the snapshot. That is DefiLlama&rsquo;s record, not proof it has none — a token may exist that its record does not carry.</li>
      <li>Implied value is not a prediction of whether or when a token is issued, or what it would trade at. It is the board&rsquo;s own reading of the protocol&rsquo;s record.</li>
      <li>Farm plans are generic steps derived from each protocol&rsquo;s category, chains, size and age. They are not financial advice, and no step asks you to pay to claim anything.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <p>Source: DefiLlama <span id="source">—</span> &middot; Model <span id="model-ver">—</span> &middot; Static page, no network requests.</p>
</footer>
<script src="../data.js"></script>
<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```
